    "norm": "Tests {@link CharSetUtils#containsAny(String, String...)}. <p>{@code containsAny} reports whether the input string contains at least one character that belongs to the given set (expressed in CharSet set-syntax, e.g. {@code \"a-e\"} for the range a..e). It is null-safe and treats a null / empty string and a null / empty set as \"no match\".</p>"
